window.products.push({"id":876081,"name":"Glasshouse Fragrances Kyoto in Bloom Replacement Scent Stems, Perfume Scented Liquidless Diffuser Refills, Essential Home Fragrance & Decor, Camellia ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xAfV9PDzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SCENT SCENE REPLACEMENT STEMS: Introducing our innovative and incredibly potent pure fragrance liquidless diffuser, our Scent Stems are refills designed to be used with our reusable, refillable Scent Scene gold metal base (sold separately). A clever candle alternative and flameless scent solution for uninterrupted ambience, and the perfect gift or home decor addition. KYOTO IN BLOOM: Created by the world’s leading perfumers and made using world class fragrance, our Kyoto In Bloom Scent Stems feature top notes of Fresh Lime, Bergamot and Citrus, middle notes of Camellia and Lotus, and base notes of Amber, Sandalwood, Musk and Vanilla. TRIPLE SCENTED PERFUME DIFFUSER: Our Scent Stems are made using only paper pulp intensely macerated with fragrance for a flameless, liquidless, continuous scent release, and a pure and exhilaratingly potent experience. A safer option than candles and traditional essential oil reed diffusers, our Scent Stems are an easy and affordable way to regularly refresh and update your home fragrance. CONTINUOUS FRAGRANCE DELIVERY: Each set of Scent Stems lasts 30 days and is available in 7 fragrances so that you can create the perfect Scent Scene for every room, mood and occasion. Scent Stems deliver an intense and long-lasting fragrance that will transform the air in any space, whether that be the office, bathroom, kitchen or bedroom. Fragrance strength can be adjusted by increasing or decreasing the number of Scent Stems used to suit your size of room or preference. HOW TO USE: Place Scent Stems into the metal vessel on a flat surface away from open windows or vents. We suggest replacing your Scent Stems every 30 days to refresh your fragrance or to increase their strength. Used Scent Stems can be recycled. Replacement Scent Stems are sold separately. Keep away from children, pets, heat & flame. Do not ignite. May cause staining, use only with supplied metal vessel and avoid contact with furniture, fabrics & finished surfaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xAfV9PDzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLASSHOUSE FRAGRANCES","source_asin":"B095BL152M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095BL152M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095BL152M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
