window.products.push({"id":876178,"name":"BestPysanky Scroll Base Metal Ornament Stand 6.5 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qFumJBPML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"6.5 Inches Tall x 4 Inches (Base Diameter) Metal Stable and Sturdy Round Metal Base Keeps your Ornament Steady and Safe Display your precious ornaments all year long on any occasion with our classic-looking ornament stands. Add some elegant touch with its handmade antique design, a perfect complement for your collectibles. Find a perfect spot for your treasures, on top of your desk or in your favorite room. Arrange them individually, in pairs or in groups, in different lengths, or with different ornament sizes. BESTPYSANKY unique ornament stands line features handmade, classic-looking displays to show off the beauty of your collectibles. This elegant tripod metal egg stand will provide a wide, sturdy base to help ensure your objects to stay in place. The unique antique design will add a touch of class to your treasures. Those who have beautifully decorated ornaments may want something more special than a regular holder to show it off. It's made of iron, so it sturdy and that allows it to display your unique ornament on any flat household surface. Find a perfect spot for your precious work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qFumJBPML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B016HF6B4U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016HF6B4U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016HF6B4U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":876179,"name":"Pluto Produkter Heart Rotary Candleholder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qPzfiQyGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When the included tea light candle is lit in the base of the rotary candle holder, the heat of the candle will make the hearts and the carousel spin, and shaped reflections move around the ceiling. Comes nicely presented in a box ideal as a gift. Remarkably sophisticated with just a touch of whimsy, this heart candle holder is a wonderful way to bring smiles with a unique display of entertainment in motion! Each of our stunning rotary candle holders is crafted from durable metal with a beautiful silver finish. Just position the flickering tea light candle (included), and within moments the heat from the flame will set the art in motion. You can add your own scented tea light and indulge in your favorite aroma. These Änglaspel are designed in and imported from Sweden. They are contemporary versions of the traditional candle chimes. Because these were designed to actually rotate and cast beautiful shadows, the metal is thin, and the item light-weight. Some of the competing rotary candle holders you will see have less detail (especially in shadow), and 4 clappers rather than our 6. When you see the Pluto Produkter AB as the manufacturer and PlutoGifts as the merchant, you can be confident of high quality and wonderful attention to detail. In order to see the hundred different choices from Pluto Produkter AB just type \"rotary candleholder\" in the search box above. For those of us who grew up with them, rotary candle holders are a seasonal blend of light and motion. They belong to a purely domestic and old-fashioned type of joy, one that emphasizes a dark room over a brightly lit one (to appreciate the dancing interplay of light and shadow); and calm over activity (so that stray air currents shouldn’t disrupt the workings). Darkness, stillness, silence: all inescapable aspects of the northern winter, and it is therefore not surprising that candleholders are such an enduring tradition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qPzfiQyGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pluto Produkter","source_asin":"B005F10EWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005F10EWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005F10EWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
