window.products.push({"id":876227,"name":"Molaxhome Forest Birds Printed Window Curtains, Printed Sheer Curtains for Kitchen,Rod Pocket Valance for Children's Room,Vintage Curtain 52\" x 18\" DC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OqblFsY-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Looking for new curtains for a bedroom? If you have a window that you'd like light to come through, but need a softening valence to cover the top, this one is excellent. Looks really cute up!  How to choose valance for windows? Great looking curtains, one panel will make the pattern showed up better, if you like curtains a little more gathered on the rods, you could buy 2 if you feel it was too skimpy for the window. it's better for the curtain's width be 1.5-2 times of the window's width, so you can create pleated ruffle rim, choose your own ornamental curtain valance lace.  Pretty pattern and colors: Colorful valances,beautiful fabric with good vivid colors. Fine workmanship on valance, very light and sheer fabric with the color and pattern that is nicely subtle, on the small window at the top of the door, the material is of EXCELLENT quality.   Heavy material: Fairly sheer valance and linen valance, decent quality. sewing was done well, the fabric has a linen feel but it's easy care. the print looks like a watercolor painting, look great in your green inspired country kitchen.  Light-blocking: nice length and wrinkle free window coverage valences for sunroom blind window, the design looks like it's perfectly created by nature itself, valences for your kitchen window a fresh look, it’s sheer enough to let some light through but not too much.  if you think they are couple inches too long，you can tie up them as long as you like,These are adorable bedroom valance, bright colors, the muted watercolor-like design and large, spaced out print if perfect for adding a little excitement to our otherwise plain decor.  Tips: A good gift sent to your mum, friends and colleagues as a holiday farmhouse valances for windows. A new collection for a new idea protects your privacy and bloom your new taste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OqblFsY-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Molaxhome","source_asin":"B08BHSGH9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHSGH9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHSGH9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
