window.products.push({"id":876334,"name":"Home Soft Things 3 Piece Shaggy Throw Blanket Pillow Covers Set Fluffy Warm Cozy Plush Decorative Throw Square Couch Cushion Cover, Burnt Orange, 50''","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-iuUSGZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Faux Fur SOPHISTICATED BEAUTY! Sumptuous softness with a luxurious layer of cozy warmth. The Shaggy Throw & Pillow Combo Set is a beautiful accent piece for sofas, beds, loungers, master suites, guest rooms, vacation homes and RV’s. This throw and pillow combo set features delectable faux fur on one side and velvety soft micro-mink on the other offering a texturized look to your decor. OFFERED IN 2 THROW SIZES! Throw and Pillow Combo Sets include 1 – Throw and 2 – Pillow Shells. Throws are offered in 2 sizes. 50 in. x 60 in. and 60 in. x 80 in. Pillow Shells: 20 in. x 20 in. each. Each pillow shell features a hidden zipper closure for a tailored look and easy washing. You may use polyester inserts, foam inserts or down and feather inserts freely. (Inserts are NOT included) THE GIFT OF COMFORT! Bridal showers, birthdays, weddings, baby showers, Mother’s Day, Father Day, Christmas or Just Because, no matter the reason, these wonderful combo sets make stellar gifts. Throw and pillow shells are elegantly stacked atop one another, wrapped in a satin ribbon with a product card then placed in a clear bag for protection. EXCLUSIVE BRAND! 100% Polyester. Experience the difference. All products are made with high-grade fibers, designs, and construction which distinguishes our products from others. We pride ourselves on superior attention to detail all the way through the design and manufacturing process. In-house manufacturing cuts out the middle man and gives you quality products at a great price. EFFORTLESS CARE! Machine Wash using cold water on a delicate cycle and tumble dry on lowest heat setting as fur can become easily matted and/ or tangled if exposed to excessive heat. Remove promptly. Your throw and pillows shells are treated to become softer after each wash, to maintain their shape, softness, and color and are made to last a lifetime with proper care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-iuUSGZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Soft Things","source_asin":"B07P1BG85H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P1BG85H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P1BG85H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
