window.products.push({"id":876386,"name":"2023 Personalized Ornament Snowman Couple Christmas Tree Ornament Artisanal Customized Decoration Family Ornament - Free Personalization","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MPPAH5hHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Put a uniquely “you” touch on your family Christmas tree with Holiday Treasures customized Christmas ornamentDecorating a Christmas tree is one of the most special traditions of the festive season. Having memorable ornaments to commemorate milestones or the special people in your life adds to the fun and memories. Whether you’re trying to capture a moment or message, with our customized Christmas ornaments, you can celebrate your life’s biggest and most special moments. Add this decorative ornament to your Christmas tree, kid’s room, living room, or mantle to give your home a much-needed festive touch.Features:- Made by you: You can add your name or the year on the ornament to add a personal touch.- Easy hanging: Comes with a beautiful red ribbon, so they are ready to hang right out of the box.- Make your holiday memories last for years: Our personalized ornaments for Christmas are made of premium quality resin that’s durable & lightweight.Give them a gift they’ll remember & cherishLooking for a present that stands out? What’s better than our one-of-a-kind Christmas personalized ornaments? Everyone loves a gift that’s made by hand and something that comes from the heart. Give your loved ones our personalized family Christmas ornament and spread the holiday cheer. It is the perfect keepsake present and stocking stuffer for your family, friends, church members, and grandparents.An Christmas ornament for every occasion:- Baby arrival- Baby’s first Christmas- Love for pets- Quarantine Christmas- And more…How to order?1. Click on the “Customize Now” button.2. Enter the personalization information in the boxes.3. Please double-check the spelling of your customization as we can’t make any changes after you place your order.4. Click on the “Add to cart” button and proceed with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MPPAH5hHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Treasures","source_asin":"B0BGD6DC73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGD6DC73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGD6DC73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
