window.products.push({"id":876394,"name":"LifeLong Needs White Bathroom Toilet Seat Warmer Cover Washable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UQpNd1bnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Can't afford the expensive electric toilet seat warmer? This is your solution! A specially woven fabric that is soft, warm and cozy to the touch. This material is stain resistant. Once you put it in water and add soap, there is not much scrubbing to do. It is made to fit perfectly on your round or elongated standard toilet seat. More importantly, it accomplishes the goal of making your trip to the bathroom more pleasant. WASHABLE!!! Warm Seat Cover will shield your body from cold related injuries Cover provides warm shelter from your cold toilet seat Prolonged exposure to cold shocks, cold chills may lead to injuries—So, prevent the skin sensation, aches and discomfort Do you dread sitting on your toilet seat especially in the winter months? Do you experience discomfort or skin soreness around your bottom and thighs during the cold winter months due to long exposure to your cold toilet seat? Do you sometimes have to pad your toilet seat to summon the courage to sit? Do you sometimes wince before you sit on your toilet seat knowing the brrrrr…will be your next reaction? Do you sometimes hold it as long as possible so you won’t have to sit on your toilet seat especially in the winter months? No more icy toilet seats; No more cold shocks; No More brrrr…; No more squatting; No more wincing; No more chills; No more cold toilet seat – not in winter, not in summer, NOT The toilet seat warmer can be hand or machine washed (hand wash highly recommended). Install in 60 seconds or less! You will appreciate the difference when you remove your toilet seat cover to wash and have to seat back on your cold toilet seat. ***Please Note*** This will NOT fit padded, foamed, cushioned, Toto or other fancy toilet seat since that configuration already takes up so much surface area. However, this will fit up to 20 inches of both round and elongated regular standard toilet seats.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UQpNd1bnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifeLong Needs","source_asin":"B018BXYT8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018BXYT8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018BXYT8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
