window.products.push({"id":876472,"name":"Christopher Knight Home Wrens END Table, Raw Brass + Brass Antique","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":77.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hHvdDSIwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Accent your interior space with a captivating look that brings your decor a raw, modern atmosphere of ingenious and eye-catching design. Handcrafted with care, this stunning side table offers your home an edgy bohemian industrial look that is perfect for holding your favorite plant arrangement or a tray of snacks. Our side table is completed with unique drill bit legs and an antique brass finish, making this great for the bedroom, living room, or any other area in need of something new. * Bohemian Industrial","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hHvdDSIwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christopher Knight Home","source_asin":"B08ND8HQ51","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ND8HQ51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ND8HQ51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":876473,"name":"Oud Al Mukhtar, Oud Al Qamar, Oud Al Habayeb Bakhoor عود بخور by Dukhni | 3 x 9 Piece Each | Assorted Arabic Bakhoor Incense | Perfect to Relax, Medit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711srsUTPFL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"CONTENTS: These Oud Bakhoor Boxes include three fragrances: Oud Al Mukhtar, Oud Al Qamar, Oud Al Habayeb. Each box includes 9 pieces of bakhoor + 1 sample of a new scent. Each scent is designed to take you on a different journey, creating an unforgettable experience FRAGRANCE DESCRIPTION: Oud Al Mukhtar is a luscious floral scent that opens with a harmonious blend of saffron, jasmine and bergamot followed by a rose and cedar heart. Oud Al Qamar opens with top notes of tiger lily and lavender followed by saffron, sandalwood and agarwood for warmth and depth. Oud Al Habayeb is an alluring floral aroma that highlights rose, pink rose and patchouli with rich velvety undertones of saffron, star anise, agarwood, cypress, cedar and amber ABOUT DUKHNI: Dukhni Bakhoor is made from a traditional recipe using sustainably-sourced natural ingredients for their aromatic properties. Each fragrance combines essential oils, which are carefully blended to create unique and evocative scents. Dukhni's bakhoor is made in small batches to ensure high quality and consistency. It will release fragrance for hours, creating a wonderfully scented atmosphere.The end result is a long-lasting, luxurious scent that will delicately perfume your home. Dukhni Bakhoor is available in a range of scents, so you can find the perfect one to suit your needs. Our bakhoor is also sustainably sourced and cruelty free, making it a more ethical choice HOW TO USE: Dukhni Bakhoor can be burned the traditional way on charcoal. Place a piece of bakhoor on hot charcoal and enjoy as fragrant smoke fills up your room. It will burn for approximately 15min but the aroma will be long lasting. Our signature burners allow for a new way of burning bakhoor with ease. Simply place a piece of bakhoor on the copper plate and light the tealight below. We recommend tealight candles with a 3.5 to 4 hour burn time. The beauty of our burner is that it burns without smoke, steadily building up the flavour of the bakhoor and ensuring its longevity. In an unventilated room, the aroma of the bakhoor will spread to about 400 square feet HERITAGE: Dukhni is a family-owned business that specializes in the art of developing fragrances and incense. Our journey began in 1907, five generations ago in Aden, an ancient port city in Yemen that formed part of the historic Incense Route. We mastered the art of blending botanical extracts, oils, flowers and woods together to craft our own aromatic recipes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711srsUTPFL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dukhni","source_asin":"B07QB34RD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QB34RD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QB34RD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
