window.products.push({"id":876516,"name":"EggFecto Egg Yolk Mixer - Egg Spinner Scrambler for Small and Large Eggs | Portable Golden Egg Maker for Hard Boiled Eggs | Easy To Use Manual Egg Sha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UI-1rftRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPINNING EGG MACHINE FOR BEAUTIFULLY MIXED, GOLD EGGS - With the EggFecto large golden egg shaker tool, you can get perfectly mixed eggs, every time. EggFecto egg yolk white mixer makes golden eggs ready for nutritious snacks and delicious meals. NO-MESS MANUAL EGG SHAKERS FOR EASY CLEANUP - Cracking open eggs to mix the whites and yolk together can be messy and time-consuming. Thankfully, our egg mixer tool features an internal single egg holder that keeps the egg secure while it mixes to a golden color. No broken egg shells or yolk mess. EGG SPINNER FOR HARD BOILED EGGS MIXES EGGS OF ALL SIZES - EggFecto egg color spinner can fit eggs of all sizes. Small or large size eggs, the EggFecto egg spinner kit is made to mix them all! A must-have egg tool for every kitchen. EGG SPINNER COLORING SHAKER FOR SNACK AND MEAL-READY EGGS - This egg scrambler in shell device is a handy pick to have in the kitchen. Use the amazing egg spinner to mix your eggs, and then peel and slice your small or large golden eggs (once cooked) for a nutritious snack or addition to your breakfast or salad! MICROWAVE EGG SCRAMBLER MAKES GOLDEN EGGS IN SECONDS - With our egg scrambler tool, all you have to do is pop the egg in, pull the string, and a golden egg will be at your fingertips. No broken egg shells or messy yolk with our egg white yolk mixer ULTRA-PORTABLE IN SHELL EGG SCRAMBLER - Whisk and mix your big eggs anywhere, anytime thanks to the small, portable design of the inside egg scrambler. The perfect inside shell egg scrambler for taking to work, on camping trips, and more. SCRAMBLED EGG SHAKER IS MADE FOR EASY ASSEMBLY - Thanks to EggFecto scrambled egg shell maker's easy to assemble design (70 x 85 x 160mm), putting it together takes just seconds. Once done, pop the hard boiled egg mixer away for easy storage. EASY TO CLEAN GOLDEN EGG SPINNER - Cleaning the EggFecto yolk scrambler is a breeze. After blending, simply disassemble the hard boiled egg scrambler, add hot, soapy water, and clean. So quick and easy! GOLDEN EGG MAKER SCRAMBLE IN SHELL MAKES THE PERFECT GIFT - Know a friend or a loved one with a knack for cooking? Our egg yolk mixer shell is a must-have kitchen tool gift for those looking to speed things up in the kitchen. Perfect for bakers, home chefs, young cooks, and parents. EGG PULLER BUILT FOR A LONG SERVICE LIFE - EggFecto boiled egg spinner is built to last with its high density drawstring puller rope, fantastic wear resistance, and overall highly durable construction. An egg yolk blender made for long-lasting, reliable performance in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UI-1rftRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EGGFECTO","source_asin":"B09B7J5VZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B7J5VZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B7J5VZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
