window.products.push({"id":876524,"name":"The Country House Collection Country House Collection 99531 Lancaster Berry Shower Curtain, 72 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SqbY7n9zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"In October 1985, Norma and Mike Delano opened The Country House in Snow Hill, Maryland. Mike was a former agricultural fertilizer salesman, and Norma was a second grade teacher. Norma quit teaching in 1972 to be a Mom to Christy and Jenny. Norma painted and sewed crafts more as the girls got older. Mike and Norma did craft shows each year. The idea of opening a store to show their handmade products as well as decorating items not available in the area came together when they opened The Country House in Snow Hill. Because of a great response at the Snow Hill store, they moved to a larger place in Salisbury, MD. After another year, they doubled that space to 5,000 sq. feet. Then after 3 years, they bought the current location, which is a 48,000 sq. foot building. It was originally built in the 1930's to be a shirt factory. It needed major repair. The family, including grandparents, plus several carpenter friends did a lot of work to prepare it to be a store. In the early 2000's, The Country House Collection had an opportunity to develop some fabric curtains and linens, to be made in India. Christy and Jenny worked along with Norma and Mike to build this collection, which now includes a broad selection of metal pieces and other household goods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SqbY7n9zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Country House Collection","source_asin":"B09Q92M6MX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q92M6MX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q92M6MX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":876525,"name":"National Parks Mountain Wall Art - Vintage Decor National Park Posters Meaningful Beauty Nature Poster, Yellowstone Print, Zion, Grand Canyon, Lassen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vXjw-scNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ 4 HIGH QUALITY MUSEUM GRADE PRINTS - Perfect for your house, bar, cafe, dining room, billiard room, hotel, office, garage, bar, restaurant, dorm, man cave. Printed on 300g premium luster paper. 🏜️ BEAUTIFUL NATIONAL PARK DECOR - Capture the essence and beauty of our National Parks with these tourist travel posters, a perfect memento to remember your trip to one of these parks or a stylish addition to help bring the vibrancy of these breathtaking National Parks into any living space. ✔️EASY TO FRAME - The standard sizes of these prints make it easy to find a suitable frame. Simply select a beautiful frame to match with your decor and you have the perfect wall art accessory in your home. ✔️ PACKAGED WITH CARE - in a sturdy cardboard tube or envelope that protects your print while in transit to ensure it reaches you in pristine condition. 👉🏻MONEY BACK GUARANTEE👈🏻 - We’re confident you will be delighted with the quality of our posters and that we offer very good value for money. But, if for any reason you want to return the poster, we offer a no hassle returns policy on all of our prints. Just contact us and we’ll make things right straight away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vXjw-scNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallbuddy","source_asin":"B07HGCNVBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HGCNVBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HGCNVBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":876526,"name":"CANWOOD Alpine II Loft Bed, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810IzM+9jcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Canwood Alpine II Loft Bed is great for saving space in your tween's room and ideal for placing a coordinating Canwood dresser or armoire. Or make it a comfortable spot for homework by adding the Canwood desk and hutch. Or expand your sleeping space by adding a matching Canwood twin size bed underneath. A contemporary loft bed, built to last with solid New Zealand pine, is a great choice for the modern bedroom. All Canwood beds are designed with security in mind; unique metal-to-metal fastening systems, employed for all connections, together with a sturdy fastened ladder and full length guardrails. You can sleep well knowing you have a Canwood bunk bed. Complete your bedroom look by adding an assortment of matching modern designed accessories: a night table, chest, dresser, armoire, desk, hutch or bookcase. Canwood Furniture will not be a passing fad, nor is it finished in a color which will quickly be out of fashion. The Canwood look is timeless. It is always in style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810IzM+9jcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANWOOD","source_asin":"B003QCJV3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003QCJV3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003QCJV3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":876527,"name":"BrewJacket Immersion Pro Fermentation Control System (Carboy/Bucket Jacket)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RTNm+h0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BrewJacket Immersion Pro Base Unit Introducing The BrewJacket Immersion Pro, a compact liquid cooler that allows you to create world class ales and lagers without a refrigerator and thermostat setup. This complete fermentation temperature control system brings your fermenting beer down as low as 35 F (20 C) below the ambient temperature in your house and can even use the ambient temperature to heat your wort back up if the temperature drops too low. Utilizing a solid state cooling systems, the Immersion Pro pulls heat out of your beer through the hard anodized transfer rod, through a cooling chip and finally to a heat sink where it is fanned out, no need for compressors, pumps or glycol. The upgraded Immersion Pro can even reverse this process, bringing ambient heat back into wort through the transfer rod to raise the temperature in your beer. This system is also super simply to operate, with only two buttons and displays. The buttons raise and lower the set temperature, while the displays provide a real time readout of both the target temperature and the current temperature in your fermenter. The compact design of the BrewJacket Immersion Pro makes cleaning and storage a breeze. The Immersion's rod easily unscrews, allowing you to place inside your fermenter when sanitizing prior to use. After your beer has completed fermentation, clean the transfer rod with soap and hop water using a kitchen sponge and let rod air dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RTNm+h0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BrewJacket","source_asin":"B07KCJBYNT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCJBYNT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCJBYNT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
