window.products.push({"id":876702,"name":"Cat Water Fountain with 5 Filters – Aookupett 3L/100oz Large Capacity Pet Water Fountain for Cats & Dogs, Dry Burning Protection Pump Cat Fountain Wat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dmf-TJyYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3L Large Capacity Ideal for Various Pets】The water tank of Aookupett pet water fountain has a large capacity of 3 liters (100 ounces). This means that once it is full, Aookupett cat drinking fountains can provide water for your small pet for a few days, or for a medium-large pet for a whole day. Even if you travel on business or short trips, you don't need to worry that your pet doesn't have fresh and healthy water to drink! 【Low Volume Warning & Ultra-quiet Pump】When the water is insufficient, the light of water pump will automatically turn red from blue to remind you to increase the water. At the same time, the pump will automatically shut off to prevent idling which can help improve the service life of water pump. The water pump of Aookupett cat fountain water bowl is powerful but super quiet. The super quiet pump is running below 40 dB, which will not affect your or your pet’s sleep. 【Triple Filtration System】The filter of Aookupett cat water fountain is made of high density microporous cotton, activated carbon and ion exchange resin. While the cotton can filter out debris, the activated carbon could remove odors and impurities. The ion exchange resin can soften tap water, remove calcium and magnesium ions in water, and reduce the probability of pets getting urinary stones. The sponge of water pump further filters impurities such as hair to protect the use of the water pump. 【Two Different Water Flow Settings】The Aookupett water fountain for cats is able to operate in two ways: waterfall (faucet drinking) and gentle fountain. Running with the water nozzle, will make the water flow form a waterfall, and the water flow will be smaller, which is ideal for small pets such as cats. While running without the nozzle, the water flow will be slower but larger, suitable for pets like dogs. You could choose the right way according to your pet's preferences! 【Eco-friendly Materials & Design】The Aookupett dog water fountain is made of food grade and BPA-free PP resin. It is safe to use for your furry friend. We advocate environmental protection, so this pet water fountain is NOT coming with an adapter. Please connect it with your idle adapter. Notice: You are subjected to submerge the filter element for at least 10 minutes before use and we recommend cleaning the fountain once every week.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dmf-TJyYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aookupett","source_asin":"B09JML4JCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JML4JCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JML4JCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
