window.products.push({"id":876776,"name":"Fantasia Materials: 1 lb Tumbled Red Jasper A Grade Stones from Brazil - Medium - 0.75\" to 1.25\" avg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WZnJQ5tvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Fantasia brand of Red Jasper \"AA\" Grade Tumbled Stones are processed and hand graded directly at our own Fantasia tumbling factory. We take great care in tumbling our stones and are very proud of the quality that we produce.Metaphysical Properties: Red Jasper is a grounding stone with a stimulating and calming effect. It connects one with the Earths vibrations bringing a greater understanding of natural events. Used by many native Indian tribes, red jasper is considered sacred with this ability to connect humans to nature. Red Jasper also is known to aid in resolving difficult situations and allows one to progress and set goals. Red Jasper is a staple of anyone's medicine bag. Stone Grading: Fantasia tumbled stones are offered in multiple grades so customers can choose the best balance of cost vs characteristics for their needs.Fantasia \"AAA\" Grade:Rough: Top QualityTumbling Time: 2+ MonthsLuster and Shine: Top PossibleQuality Control: Hand Checked at Every PhaseImperfections Allowed*: Almost NoneCost: ExpensiveFantasia \"AA\" Grade:Rough: High GradeTumbling Time: 1-2 MonthsLuster and Shine: SuperiorQuality Control: Hand Checked at Most PhasesImperfections Allowed*: Semi-LimitedCost: ReasonableFantasia \"A\" Grade:Rough: Standard GradeTumbling Time: Up to 1 MonthLuster and Shine: StandardQuality Control: Hand Checked at Final PhaseImperfections Allowed*: SomeCost: Inexpensive* Please note: Some material types will have imperfections even in high and top grades due to their natural characteristics. The number of acceptable imperfections is relative to the material type being tumbled and comparison between the different grades. If you are interested in seeing the different grades of Fantasia's tumbled Red Jasper enter \"Fantasia Red Jasper\" into any Amazon search bar to see all available grades.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WZnJQ5tvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasia","source_asin":"B00P4SXEOC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-876776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P4SXEOC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P4SXEOC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
